### Download all data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources
Accept: application/json

### Get specific record by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Create a new record
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Room B",
  "type": "ROOM",
  "openingTime": "09:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00",
  "active": true
}

### Update record
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/resources/63a8d296-2fd6-4f55-a52d-76c3136d27e8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Room C",
  "type": "ROOM",
  "openingTime": "09:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00",
  "active": true
}
### Delete record by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resources/{id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a resource that does not exist -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Get a resource with an id that is not a UUID -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resources/not-a-uuid
Accept: application/json

### Create a resource with a blank title -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "type": "ROOM",
  "openingTime": "09:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00",
  "active": true
}

### Create a resource with an unknown type -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Room B",
  "openingTime": "09:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00"
}

### Create a resource with malformed JSON -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Room B",
  "type": "ROOM",
  "openingTime": "09:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00"


### POST on a path with an id (method not allowed) -> 405
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resources/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Room C",
  "type": "ROOM",
  "openingTime": "09:00:00",
  "closingTime": "18:00:00",
  "active": true
}

### Request an unknown path -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/unknownPath
Accept: application/json